  "prompt": "A dashboard adds up daily sessions to get a weekly total. Check that total for the Dublin days 7 to 13 December 2025 (by event_date), counting sessions from every event that carries both a user_pseudo_id and a ga_session_id; a session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id. Return three columns, in this order: week_sessions (the distinct sessions over the seven days), sum_of_daily_sessions (each day's distinct sessions, added up) and difference (sum_of_daily_sessions minus week_sessions). Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
